msgid ""
"Currency actually sent to EpayNC (vads_currency). It may differ from the "
"transaction currency when the amount was auto-converted."
msgstr "实际被寄入EpayNC的货币(vads money). 当数额自动转换时,可能不同于交易货币."

#. module: payment_epaync
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_epaync.field_payment_provider__epaync_gateway_currency_id
msgid ""
"Currency actually sent to EpayNC as 'vads_currency' (ISO 4217 numeric code). The order total is automatically converted from the customer currency to this currency using Odoo's exchange rates (the fixed 1 EUR = 119.3317 XPF peg is used as a fallback if no rate is configured).\n"
"EpayNC New Caledonia contracts usually only accept XPF (953): keep this set to XPF to allow EUR/USD/any other currency at checkout. If EpayNC enabled another currency on your shop/contract, select it here. Leave empty to send the order currency unchanged (only do this if that currency is enabled at EpayNC, otherwise the gateway returns error 10 'vads_currency Currency not found')."
msgstr ""
"货币实际作为\"vads 货币\"(ISO 4217个数字代码)被发送到EpayNC. 订单总额会使用奥多的汇率(固定的1欧元=119.3317 XPF peg如果不配置汇率,则作为倒置)从客户货币自动转换为这种货币.\n"
"EpayNC 新喀里多尼亚合同通常只接受 XPF(953):将这一套保留给 XPF,以便在结账时允许欧元/美元/任何其他货币。 如果 EpayNC 在您的商店/ 合约上启用了另一种货币, 请在此选择 。 留空以不变地发送定单货币( 仅在 EpayNC 启用该货币时这样做, 否则网关返回错误 10“ vads  货币找不到 ” ) ."

